msgid "Connecting to the Pixhawk"
msgstr "连接到 Pixhawk"

#: ../../source/docs/common-smart-battery-rotoye.rst:19
#: 0d6ec615fc8848618eb2eecf295f62e2 56df6c1a4e4d4d39aa1a27eb3f317c08
#: c37428bc02d04bd3828498d8d6f668a0 c4d334bd72134383b1e52a03cbe1199c
#: cba942cc79ca47329f717002f8219810
msgid ""
"Rotoye Batmon uses XT90 connectors with I2C pins built-in. `See Rotoye "
"Tutorials <https://rotoye.com/batmon-tutorial/>`__ for more details."
msgstr ""
"Rotoye Batmon 使用内置 I2C 引脚的 XT90 连接器。更多详情请参阅 `Rotoye 教程 "
"<https://rotoye.com/batmon-tutorial/>`__。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-smart-battery-rotoye.rst:21
#: 379ae526afb940f895a53af8e791aaa3 59f03cebc9c14ea898cda1ee37935265
#: 8fe44bb8748e4154a2ca72fffe728f74 a4c184840c764bb2953cd328ae76aba5
#: ac4a6d9e3ff146009e2a10cf8692dbda
msgid ""
"Multiple BatMon-equipped batteries can be connected, in series, to the same "
"I2C bus using an opto-isolator; `Read more "
"<https://github.com/rotoye/batmon_reader/tree/ArduinoAsMaster/Tutorials/running_multiple_batmons>`__"
msgstr ""
"多个配备 BatMon 的电池可通过光耦隔离器串联连接到同一 I2C 总线；`了解更多 "
"<https://github.com/rotoye/batmon_reader/tree/ArduinoAsMaster/Tutorials/running_multiple_batmons>`__"
